§D GOAL+SUCCESS

  goal : one obvious public door → robust free social habitat → free consent-bounded Apocv2 conversation → optional paid mutual-commission workflow

  success.1 :
    anonymous visitor reaches `/`
    ⇒ understands free social platform + free Apocv2 chat + optional paid commissions
    ⇒ has exactly one primary action : `Enter free`

  success.2 :
    free account enters `/space`
    ⇒ rooms + threads + reactions + presence + safety-controls operational
    ⇒ moderated Apocv2 conversation operational
    ∧ no payment/entitlement required

  success.3 :
    paid member may offer commission
    ⇒ server verifies generation-membership
    ⇒ requester + Apocv2 accept same versioned scope
    ⇒ generation may begin
    ∧ admin reaches `/admin` only after server-verified role + AAL2
    ⇒ diagnostics + commissions + moderation + audit are operational
    ∧ old pages/APIs cannot execute inside new deployment

