§D MEMBERSHIP+CHECKOUT.FLOW `/membership`

  § information-before-payment
    free social + free Apocv2 chat remain explicit
    paid benefit = eligibility to propose commissions + measured generation-capacity
    membership N! guarantees acceptance of any particular brief
    unused-capacity/decline policy visible before payment
    price + cadence + capacity + concurrency + renewal + cancellation + refund visible
    refusal/decline/pause rights identical across free+paid

  § state-machine
    unauthenticated
      → `/auth?next=/membership`
    verified-account ∧ ¬generation-entitled
      → plan-summary
      → explicit service-terms + billing-terms acknowledgement
      → Stripe-hosted Checkout
    checkout-return
      → server-verifies session-user + Checkout-session
      → poll entitlement until webhook-commit ∨ timeout
    entitlement.active
      → `/space?view=commissions`
    entitlement.pending
      → honest pending-state + retry/status/support
    entitlement.existing
      → `/space?view=commissions` + account.billing link

  § billing-invariants
    one recurring product + one currency + one cadence @ launch
    server derives `user_id` from validated session
    N! caller-supplied player/user identity
    success_url + cancel_url = server-owned origin constants
    Checkout.mode = subscription
    Stripe.customer bound one-to-one to account
    webhook-signature verified against raw body
    webhook-event inserted `received`
      → effect transaction
      → entitlement/subscription upsert
      → event `processed`
    failure ⇒ event `failed` + retryable
    N! mark processed before side-effects
    event ordering N! assumed
    commission-offer eligibility = server entitlement state ¬ checkout-return query-string
    social/chat access N! depends-on subscription state
    customer-portal supports payment-method + invoices + cancellation

  § access-state-map
    trialing | active          ⇒ allow-new-commission-offer
    past_due                   ⇒ grace(policy-required) ∨ deny-new-offer
    unpaid | incomplete_expired | canceled | refunded ⇒ deny-new-offer
    admin_comp.active          ⇒ allow-new-offer ⊗ audit
    suspended                 ⇒ deny-social+commission under separate moderation-case
    accepted/in-progress commission :
      N! auto-cancel solely because subscription lapses
      commission-specific agreement governs completion/cancellation
    delivered artifact :
      remains accessible after membership cancellation
      subject-to account/privacy/legal retention policy

  § decision.required
    product-label
    price
    cadence recommended=monthly
    trial recommended=none @ private-beta
    grace-period recommended=3-days
    refund-window
    public-purchase ∨ invite-required
    included-capacity + one-active-commission recommendation
    membership-lapse behavior for pending/unaccepted proposals
    unused capacity : rollover ∨ expire ∨ credit/refund

