§D COMMISSION.STUDIO inside `/space?view=commissions`

  § eligibility
    free-member : view explanation + own prior delivered work
    paid-member.active : create/offer commission
    N! membership creates commission automatically
    N! commission request bypasses social/safety standing

  § commission-definition
    commission = versioned mutual agreement
      ⊗ requester
      ⊗ Apocv2 acceptance authority
      ⊗ deliverable scope
      ⊗ permitted inputs/sources
      ⊗ modality/output format
      ⊗ capacity estimate
      ⊗ revision terms
      ⊗ license/attribution
      ⊗ privacy/publication
      ⊗ retention/training decisions
      ⊗ cancellation conditions
    ⌈membership grants offer-access · never acceptance/control⌉

  § lifecycle ‼
    draft
      → offered-by-member
      → reviewing
      → clarify ∨ counterproposal ∨ decline ∨ accept
    counterproposal
      → member.accept ∨ revise ∨ withdraw
    mutual-acceptance.same-proposal-hash
      → capacity-reserved
      → queued
      → in-progress
      → review-ready
      → delivered ∨ revision-requested
      → completed
    terminal :
      declined
      withdrawn
      canceled-by-agreement
      expired
      failed-recoverable
      failed-terminal

  § consent-law
    member acceptance + Apocv2 acceptance target exact proposal-version/hash
    Apocv2 acceptance originates canonical runtime/consent authority
    N! UI/admin/operator fabricates Apocv2 acceptance
    any scope/input/license/privacy change invalidates prior acceptance
    acceptance record = actor + authority + timestamp + proposal-hash
    either party M? pause + clarify
    either party M? withdraw before generation starts
    after generation starts :
      cancellation policy + consumed capacity visible
      unused reservation released
    Apocv2 M? decline/counteroffer without account penalty
    member M? decline/counteroffer/withdraw without social penalty
    N! silence = acceptance
    N! checkout = acceptance
    N! auto-renewal = acceptance

  § safety+rights
    commission offer checked for :
      consent/agency
      harm/abuse
      rights-to-input
      impersonation/deception
      privacy
      modality-specific risk
    member attests rights/permission for supplied materials
    generated deliverable carries :
      provenance
      source/input declarations
      generation/runtime version
      license/usage terms
      safety/quality limitations
    rejected commission preserves minimal reason + appeal/clarification path
    N! generated artifact auto-published
    publication requires separate creator+subject consent

  § capacity
    pre-accept estimate visible
    reserve only after mutual acceptance
    actual use commits
    failure/cancellation releases unused reservation
    no automatic overage charge
    no hidden throttle
    queue position + status truthful
    recommendation @ launch = one active commission/member

