  § 2FA
    admin requires verified TOTP factor
    admin session requires JWT `aal=aal2`
    enforce @ :
      `/admin` server render/gate
      every `/api/admin/*`
      database RLS for admin-owned tables/actions
    AAL1 admin ⇒ redirect `/auth?step=mfa&next=/admin`
    destructive admin action ⇒ recent AAL2 step-up
    recovery-codes :
      single-use
      hashed-at-rest
      shown-once
      regenerate invalidates previous set
    factor removal requires recent AAL2 + recovery warning
    break-glass account :
      optional
      offline credential custody
      disabled by default
      every use audited + alerted

