§D LEGACY.ISOLATION+MIGRATION

  § recommended architecture ‼
    create fresh deployable root `apocky-social/` sibling to current `cssl-edge/`
    reuse stack :
      Next.js + React + Supabase + Stripe
    port only audited seams
    N! import old `pages/` tree
    N! deploy old API routes in new build
    old app remains byte-preserved during cutover

  § why
    in-place pruning @ dirty_entries=142
      ⇒ high collision + accidental loss + hidden-route risk
    new deploy-root
      ⇒ route isolation by filesystem + independent preview + atomic domain switch

  § preflight
    capture :
      git HEAD + branch
      `git status --porcelain=v2`
      tracked diff + staged diff
      untracked inventory
      route inventory
      SHA-256 manifest of legacy source excluding secrets+caches
    identify secrets/env by name only · N! archive secret values
    produce rollback manifest

  § archive
    old source stays outside new deploy-root
    deployment retained under private/non-indexed rollback URL
    legacy content M? copied into non-served `archive/` only after hash verification
    N! legacy directory under `public/`
    N! destructive deletion before acceptance + explicit authority

  § cutover
    new app deploys separate preview/project
    sandbox acceptance passes
    production data migration rehearsed
    DNS/domain assignment switches to new deployment
    smoke + free-social + free-Apocv2 + synthetic membership/commission + admin-AAL2 tests
    old deployment retained for bounded rollback window

  § rollback
    domain assignment returns to prior deployment
    schema changes additive until rollback window closes
    webhook endpoints dual-delivery only under explicit migration procedure
    no destructive schema drop during launch

§D EXECUTION.PLAN.after-signoff

  § phase.0 preserve+seal
    outputs = manifest + hashes + route ledger + rollback record
    gate = exact legacy bytes recoverable

  § phase.1 greenfield shell
    outputs = new deploy-root + route allowlist + visual tokens + `/` + `/auth`
    gate = no old route/API present in build manifest

  § phase.2 authority+safety-foundation
    outputs = free-member/moderator/admin roles + RLS + moderation-case model + TOTP/AAL2 admin gate
    gate = UI + API + DB enforce role/AAL + report/appeal lifecycle persists

  § phase.3 free-social-platform ‼
    outputs = rooms + messages + threads + reactions + presence + profiles + artifacts + block/mute/report
    gate = two independent free accounts converse/co-create + exercise safety controls across fresh browsers

  § phase.4 free-Apocv2-chat ‼
    outputs = direct chat + room invocation + context envelope + moderated streaming turn + runtime status
    gate = free account succeeds without billing + consent/safety/failure states truthful

  § phase.5 optional-membership
    outputs = one Stripe subscription + webhook inbox + generation-entitlement + portal
    gate = Stripe test-mode lifecycle affects commission eligibility only; free social/chat unchanged

  § phase.6 commission-engine
    outputs = versioned proposal + dual acceptance + capacity reservation + run/delivery/revision lifecycle
    gate = no generation starts before matching acceptance hashes + paid member completes one consented commission

  § phase.7 admin
    outputs = overview + diagnostics + access + moderation + commissions + audit
    gate = sanitized current data + audited mutations + AAL2 step-up

  § phase.8 migration+cutover
    outputs = compatibility redirects/410s + production domain switch
    gate = sandbox + production acceptance + rollback rehearsal

§T ACCEPTANCE

  route :
    only allowlisted routes appear in build
    every legacy URL maps exactly to redirect ∨ 410
    no duplicate public entry-point
  checkout :
    free member uses social + Apocv2 chat with no subscription
    paid member → subscription → generation-entitlement → commission eligibility
    duplicate/out-of-order webhook safe
    cancel/refund/past-due updates new-commission eligibility
    cancel/refund/past-due N! revokes free social/chat
  admin :
    non-admin denied
    admin AAL1 denied/challenged
    admin AAL2 allowed
    every mutation audited
  social :
    message/thread/reaction/artifact round-trip across two sessions
    RLS prevents cross-authority read/write
    degraded realtime and Apocv2 states recover
    free account completes direct + room Apocv2 turn
    report/mute/block observed across affected sessions
    moderator case/action + member appeal round-trip
    automated quarantine visible + reversible
  commission :
    free member cannot offer new commission but retains free chat
    paid member can offer commission
    mismatched proposal hashes deny start
    either party decline/counter/withdraw path works
    matching mutual acceptance reserves visible capacity
    delivered artifact carries provenance+license+privacy contract
    membership lapse does not silently destroy accepted work/deliverables
  consent :
    training off by default
    context scope visible
    payment does not create Apocv2 acceptance
    publication consent separate from commission consent
    revoke/export/delete paths observed
  quality :
    responsive desktop/tablet/mobile
    keyboard + screen-reader smoke
    WCAG contrast
    no console errors
    no broken link
    production smoke after cutover

§D SIGNOFF.DECISIONS

  Q1 product public-name?
    recommendation : platform=`Apocky` · participant=`Apocv2` · `The Clearing`=room-name only

  Q2 free-access perimeter?
    recommendation :
      anonymous public-room read
      free verified account required for post/reaction/Apocv2 chat
      no human-DMs @ v1

  Q3 paid generation-membership?
    recommendation : one monthly plan · one active commission · visible capacity · admin-comp access for testing
    historical-design-study : ○ `$19/month` ¬ ratified-price
    required : price + included capacity + refund window + public-purchase vs invite-required

  Q4 commission modalities?
    required : text | image | audio | video | code | 3D | mixed
    recommendation : launch only modalities passing end-to-end runtime+quality+safety acceptance
    N! advertise current `/api/generate/3d` stub

  Q5 free co-creation MVP?
    recommendation : rooms + threads + shared Markdown artifact + revision history
    defer : file storage + canvas + IDE

  Q6 safety+age perimeter?
    recommendation : 18+ launch beta + report/mute/block + authorized human moderation + appeal
    required : private-beta ∨ public registration

  Q7 legacy content disposition?
    recommendation : private preserved archive + semantic redirects for product routes + 410 for obsolete unrelated pages

  Q8 conversation learning?
    invariant recommendation : off by default + separately opt-in + granular + revocable

  explicit-signoff-form :
    `APPROVE SOCIAL RESET v2`
    plus Q1..Q7 answers/edits

